.
.  Create a GIF file for a dex main effects plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 25
READ SHEESLE2.DAT Y PROC PLANT SPEED SHIFT
.
TITLE SIZE 5
TIC LABEL SIZE 5
LABEL SIZE 5
CHARACTER X ALL
CHARACTER SIZE 5 ALL
LINE BLANK ALL
XLIMITS 1 4
MAJOR XTIC MARK NUMBER 4
MINOR XTIC MARK NUMBER 0
Y1LABEL DEFECTS
X1LABEL FACTORS
.  X1TIC MARK LABEL FORMAT ALPHA
.  X1TIC MARK LABEL WELD PLANT SPEED SHIFT
XTIC OFFSET 0.5 0.5
.
PRE-ERASE OFF
MULTIPLOT 2 2
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 100
.
TITLE MEAN EFFECTS
DEX MEAN EFFECTS PLOT Y PROC PLANT SPEED SHIFT
TITLE MEDIAN EFFECTS
DEX MEDIAN EFFECTS PLOT Y PROC PLANT SPEED SHIFT
TITLE STANDARD DEVIATION EFFECTS
DEX STANDARD DEVIATION EFFECTS PLOT Y PROC PLANT SPEED SHIFT
TITLE RANGE EFFECTS
DEX RANGE EFFECTS PLOT Y PROC PLANT SPEED SHIFT
.
END OF MULTIPLOT
QUIT
